OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 18 FEB
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GNikola Meeuwsen joins the
OL,6,     GConcertgebouw Chamber Orchestra
OL,7,     Gin Utrecht to play Mozart's Piano
OL,8,     GConcerto No.9, plus a highlight
OL,9,     Gfrom the RNCM International Brass
OL,10,     GBand Festival.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GLive from the Chapel of Merton
OL,13,     GCollege, Oxford on Ash Wednesday,
OL,14,     Gwith music by MacMillan, Byrd and
OL,15,     GTallis.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Rachmaninov
OL,17,     GRachmaninov is forced to embark
OL,18,     Gon a new full-time career as a
OL,19,     Gconcert pianist, through his
OL,20,     Gfirst months as a refugee in
OL,21,     GEurope, and his passage west
OL,22,     Gagain, to New York.
